{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And Moses said, six hundred thousand on foot</b> etc. Master of the universe — You said to me: 'Gather for me seventy men, and they shall bear with you, and you shall say to the people, and HaShem shall give you meat' by means of these seventy men. Is there power in the hands of seventy men to give meat to six hundred thousand men on foot, apart from the little ones?"], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:17:27.253437034Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}